      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The number of terms is \\[ \\frac{40-20}{\\frac{1}{5}}+1=101. \\] Their average is \\(\\frac{20+40}{2}=30,\\) so the sum is \\(101\\cdot30=3030.\\) Thus the correct answer is B.",
